[engl]
{100}{}{Tandi}
{200}{}{The minx of Shady Sands.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{2000}{}{Well..how do you like our little town? Bored yet?}
{2010}{}{It's okay. Can I ask you a few questions, though?}
{2020}{}{Hell, yes. There's nothing to do here but watch the Brahma mate.}
{2030}{}{I guess it's okay.}
{2040}{}{Well, yes. It is a bit boring.}
{3000}{}{Sure, I guess. I've never been out of here, so I don't know what help I can be. So, what'cha need?}
{3010}{}{What else is around these parts?}
{3020}{}{What's going on around here?}
{3030}{}{Have you heard any stories from down south?}
{3040}{}{How do you like it here?}
{3050}{}{End conversation.}
{3060}{}{What's going on around here?}
{4000}{}{Yeah. Well you don't live here. There's nothing interesting to do, and believe you me, Brahma Tipping gets old real fast.}
{4010}{}{If you're so bored, why don't you leave?}
{4020}{}{Well, I'm sure you're exaggerating.}
{4030}{}{It seems nice and safe here.}
{5000}{}{Me, leave? I wish. I don't know enough to leave alone and no one else wants to go, and worst of all, my father says he would have a heart attack if something happened to me!}
{5010}{}{Tough situation. Can I ask you a few questions, though?}
{5020}{}{Shoot, I have to go. Good luck.}
{6000}{}{Junktown's to the southwest, but I don't know how far. Then there's some weird place below that called the City of Death. Oh, oh yeah there's this other place...Oh, shoot, what was that? Oh, yeah, the Hub.}
{6010}{}{Thanks.}
{7000}{}{We got Rad Scorpions! I mean, I know it's not a good thing, but no one's died from the stings. And it's the closest thing to excitement we've got here!}
{7010}{}{[Back]}
{8000}{}{Nothing much, since you whomped those Rad Scorpions. Gee, I wish I could have seen that.}
{8010}{}{[Back]}

